     "type": "text",
     "text": "half marathon oct 15 (bay area). training block 4 since august, 9-11h/week mostly zone 2 running + some cycling, 1 workout/week (tempo or 3x2mi at threshold). goal sub 1:25. how should i taper the last 2 weeks",
     "citations": []
